  "headline": "Indonesian Police Dismiss General Eko Hadi Over Illegal Wiretapping",
  "seoTitle": "General Eko Hadi Dismissed by Indonesian Police",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian police have dismissed Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso following an ethics hearing regarding his involvement in illegal wiretapping activities.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso was dishonorably discharged from the Indonesian National Police following an ethics committee decision.",
    "The officer was found to have conspired to conduct illegal wiretapping using official law enforcement technology and resources.",
    "During the disciplinary proceedings, the general expressed remorse for his actions and has submitted an appeal against the dismissal."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have officially dismissed Irjen Eko Hadi Santoso following a formal ethics investigation into allegations of unauthorized wiretapping involving high-level government figures. Reports indicate that the officer utilized police-sanctioned surveillance tools and infrastructure to conduct these activities. During the Komisi Kode Etik Profesi (KKEP) hearing, which included the presentation of defense witnesses, the officer expressed regret and issued an apology for his conduct. Despite his stated remorse, the police leadership maintained that there is no impunity for members who violate professional standards, leading to the decision to dishonorably discharge him from service. Following the verdict, the former officer has initiated the formal appeal process to contest the disciplinary outcome. The case has highlighted internal concerns regarding the management and oversight of specialized surveillance technology within the police force.",
